# D3-FE-002: Sourdough allocates carbon to acid, alcohol and gas
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 40mL @ 27C
add v1 sucrose 1g
add v1 sourdough_starter 5g
add v2 water 40mL @ 27C
add v2 sourdough_starter 5g
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
wait 12h
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
chromatograph v1
inspect
